HB0076 Prior authorization-amendments.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Brown, L, Clouston, Geringer,
Styvar and Wylie and Senator(s) Brennan
AN ACT relating to the insurance code; requiring prior authorization adverse
determinations to be determined by Wyoming-licensed health care providers;
requiring prior authorization appeals to be reviewed by Wyoming-licensed health
care providers; specifying applicability; and providing for an effective date.
